  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cashews from Tanzania</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Johnny Cashew imports processed cashew nuts directly from its origin in East Africa. In the Netherlands Johnny Cashew sells the cashew nuts directly to the end consumer therewith guaranteeing a reduction on food miles by 125,000 KM and improving livelihoods in East Africa. This DGGF-TA project focusses on further development of the supply chain and a first import from Tanzania.</narrative>
  </description>
